  "translation": "Na Yahwe i givim ⟨את⟩ pes bilong ol manmeri bilong en long ai bilong ol man Mitsrayim; arapela tu, man Mose i bikpela tru long graun bilong Mitsrayim, long ai bilong ol wokman bilong Faro, na long ai bilong ol manmeri.",
